    modify, or remove certain features, content, mechanics, system requirements,
    and other elements of the game.\r\n\r\nCertain updates may be required for certain
    features of the game to continue functioning.\r\n\r\nWe do not guarantee that
    every feature of Woolly Bunny will remain permanently available or that the game
    will always operate without changes.\r\n\r\n10. CHANGES TO THIS AGREEMENT\r\n\r\nWe
    may modify this Agreement as Woolly Bunny, applicable laws, or the Services develop.\r\n\r\nChanges
    will take effect on the date specified in the updated version unless otherwise
    required by applicable law.\r\n\r\nIf a change materially affects your rights
    or obligations, we will use reasonable efforts to provide notice before the change
    takes effect.\r\n\r\nIf applicable law requires us to obtain your renewed consent
    to material changes, we will request such consent before you continue using the
    applicable Services.\r\n\r\nTo the extent permitted by applicable law, your continued
    use of the Services after the changes take effect may constitute your acceptance
    of the revised Agreement.\r\n\r\n11. PURCHASES AND VIRTUAL ITEMS\r\n\r\nIf Woolly
    Bunny or related Services allow you to acquire in-game currency, items, cosmetic
    content, or other digital objects (collectively, \u201CVirtual Items\u201D),
    such items are provided to you under a limited right of use and do not constitute
    personal property in the same manner as tangible goods.\r\n\r\nVirtual Items
    are not money, electronic money, investments, securities, or other financial
    assets and, unless expressly provided otherwise by law or the terms of the applicable
    purchase, have no monetary value outside the Services.\r\n\r\nVirtual Items may
    not be sold, exchanged, transferred, or redeemed for real money unless such functionality
    is expressly authorized by the Rights Holder.\r\n\r\nThe Rights Holder may modify,
    restrict, or discontinue access to Virtual Items as part of operating the Services,
    subject to consumer protection laws and other mandatory requirements of applicable
    law.\r\n\r\nPurchases made through a third-party distribution platform, including
    Steam, Epic Games Store, Microsoft Store, PlayStation Store, or another marketplace,
    may also be subject to the terms and policies of the applicable platform.\r\n\r\n12.
    THIRD-PARTY PLATFORMS AND SERVICES\r\n\r\nThe game may be distributed through
    third-party platforms and stores.\r\n\r\nYour use of such platforms is governed
    by their own terms, licenses, and privacy policies.\r\n\r\nThe Rights Holder
    is not responsible for changes to, restrictions on, or discontinuation of any
    third-party platform unless caused by a breach of an obligation by the Rights
    Holder.\r\n\r\nWhere there is a conflict between the terms of a third-party platform
    and this Agreement, applicable mandatory terms governing services directly provided
    by that platform may take precedence.\r\n\r\n13. DISCLAIMER OF WARRANTIES\r\n\r\nTo
    the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Woolly Bunny and the Services
    are provided \u201CAS IS\u201D and \u201CAS AVAILABLE.\u201D\r\n\r\nTo the maximum
    extent permitted by law, the Rights Holder does not warrant that:\r\n\r\n1. the
    game will operate without errors or interruptions;\r\n2. the game will be compatible
    with all devices or configurations;\r\n3. all errors will be corrected;\r\n4.
    the Services will remain continuously available;\r\n5. the game will meet your
    particular expectations.\r\n\r\nNothing in this section limits any consumer guarantees,
    warranties, rights, or remedies that cannot be excluded or limited under applicable
    law.\r\n\r\n14. LIMITATION OF LIABILITY\r\n\r\nTo the maximum extent permitted
    by applicable law, the Rights Holder shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental,
    special, punitive, or consequential damages arising out of or in connection with
    your use of, or inability to use, the game or the Services.\r\n\r\nTo the maximum
    extent permitted by law, the total aggregate liability of the Rights Holder to
    you in connection with Woolly Bunny shall not exceed the amount actually paid
    by you for the applicable copy of the game during the twelve months preceding
    the event giving rise to the claim.\r\n\r\nThe limitations in this section do
    not apply to the extent that applicable law prohibits the exclusion or limitation
    of such liability, including liability that cannot legally be excluded or limited.\r\n\r\n15.
    INDEMNIFICATION\r\n\r\nTo the extent permitted by applicable law, you agree to
    indemnify and hold harmless the Rights Holder from reasonable losses, expenses,
    and third-party claims arising directly from:\r\n\r\n1. your material breach
    of this Agreement;\r\n2. your unlawful use of the Services;\r\n3. your violation
    of the rights of any third party.\r\n\r\nThis section does not apply to the extent
    such indemnification is prohibited by applicable law or relates to the actions
    of the Rights Holder itself.\r\n\r\n16. TERMINATION OF THE LICENSE\r\n\r\nYour
    license terminates automatically if you materially breach the terms of this Agreement,
    unless otherwise required by mandatory applicable law.\r\n\r\nUpon termination
    of the license, you must stop using the game and delete all copies of the game
    under your control to the extent permitted or required by applicable law.\r\n\r\nThe
    Rights Holder may also suspend or terminate individual Services where reasonably
    necessary to maintain security, protect intellectual property, comply with applicable
    law, or operate the Services.\r\n\r\nTermination of the license does not release
    either party from rights or obligations that by their nature are intended to
    survive termination.\r\n\r\n17. FORCE MAJEURE\r\n\r\nThe Rights Holder shall
    not be liable for delays or failures to perform its obligations resulting from
    circumstances beyond its reasonable control, including natural disasters, wars,
    governmental actions, infrastructure failures, outages of third-party services,
    power outages, widespread technical failures, or other similar events.\r\n\r\n18.
    SEVERABILITY\r\n\r\nIf any provision of this Agreement is determined to be invalid,
    unlawful, or unenforceable, that provision shall remain enforceable to the maximum
    extent permitted by law, and the remaining provisions shall remain in full force
    and effect.\r\n\r\nIf a provision cannot be enforced, it shall be excluded only
    to the extent necessary and shall not automatically invalidate the entire Agreement.\r\n\r\n19.
    WAIVER\r\n\r\nFailure or delay by the Rights Holder to exercise any right under
    this Agreement shall not constitute a waiver of that right.\r\n\r\nAny waiver
    must be made in writing by an authorized representative of the Rights Holder
    unless otherwise provided by law.\r\n\r\n20. ENTIRE AGREEMENT\r\n\r\nThis Agreement,
    the Privacy Policy, and any other documents expressly incorporated by reference
    constitute the entire agreement between you and the Rights Holder regarding your
    use of Woolly Bunny and supersede all prior versions of agreements relating to
    the same subject matter.\r\n\r\nIf there is a conflict between separate documents,
    they shall be applied in accordance with this Agreement and applicable law.\r\n\r\n21.
    ASSIGNMENT\r\n\r\nYou may not assign or transfer your rights or obligations under
    this Agreement without the prior written consent of the Rights Holder, except
    where such transfer is expressly permitted by law.\r\n\r\nThe Rights Holder may
    assign its rights and obligations to a successor in connection with a reorganization,
    sale of relevant assets, transfer of intellectual property, or other lawful change
    in ownership of Woolly Bunny.\r\n\r\n22. FINAL PROVISIONS\r\n\r\nThis Agreement
    becomes effective for the user upon valid acceptance or, where such formation
    is permitted by applicable law, upon the commencement of use of the game.\r\n\r\nBy
    using Woolly Bunny after accepting this Agreement, you confirm your agreement
    to its terms.\r\n\r\nEffective Date: December 11, 2024\r\n\r\n\xA9 2024 ASTERID.
    All rights reserved.\r\n"
